<title>UK: GECC sets 100 million SFR five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 100 million SFR five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    26.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.45    PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
